{
  "survey": {
    "type": "survey",
    "id": "survey_lead_qualification_sales_conversion",
    "title": "<h1>企业版产品需求评估</h1>",
    "description": "<p>这是一份更贴近真实销售转化场景的线索筛选问卷示例。系统会根据你的采购阶段、预算区间和后续偏好，把你带到不同的结束页，并在<strong>提交成功后</strong>跳转到对应的下一步页面。</p>",
    "attribute": {
      "onePageOneQuestion": true,
      "allowBack": true,
      "media": []
    }
  },
  "questions": [
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_role",
      "title": "<h2>你当前在采购决策中扮演什么角色？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>用于帮助我们判断后续更适合给你演示、资料还是自助方案。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_role_decision_maker",
          "title": "<p>最终决策者 / 负责人</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_role_evaluator",
          "title": "<p>调研评估 / 项目推进人</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_role_executor",
          "title": "<p>实际使用者 / 执行同学</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "question_core_needs",
      "title": "<h2>你当前最关注哪些能力？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>可多选，帮助我们快速判断更适合给你哪类解决方案。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_need_lead_capture",
          "title": "<p>线索收集与表单转化</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_need_automation",
          "title": "<p>自动化跟进与分配</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_need_crm",
          "title": "<p>客户管理与销售协同</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_need_ai_assistant",
          "title": "<p>AI 助手 / 智能客服 / 话术辅助</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_need_other",
          "title": "<p>其他，请说明</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          },
          "child": [
            {
              "type": "input",
              "id": "child_need_other_text",
              "title": "<p>补充需求</p>",
              "attribute": {
                "required": true,
                "dataType": "text",
                "placeholder": "请补充你最核心的业务目标",
                "maxLength": 200
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "radio",
      "id": "question_timeline",
      "title": "<h2>你预计什么时候启动采购或上线？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>这是最关键的分流题，我们会根据你的时间窗口安排不同的后续动作。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_timeline_urgent",
          "title": "<p>2 周内，希望尽快推进</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_timeline_this_quarter",
          "title": "<p>1-3 个月内，正在评估中</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_timeline_research",
          "title": "<p>先了解方案，还没到决策阶段</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_timeline_no_plan",
          "title": "<p>暂无明确计划，先看看</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "input",
      "id": "question_contact_hot",
      "title": "<h2>请留下你的联系方式，方便我们尽快安排演示</h2>",
      "description": "<p>适合已经有明确推进计划的团队，提交后我们会优先安排产品顾问联系你。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_contact_hot_name",
          "title": "<p>姓名</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "text",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入你的姓名",
            "maxLength": 40
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_contact_hot_company",
          "title": "<p>公司名称</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "text",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入公司名称",
            "maxLength": 80
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_contact_hot_phone",
          "title": "<p>手机号</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "tel",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入方便联系的手机号",
            "maxLength": 20
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "input",
      "id": "question_contact_consult",
      "title": "<h2>请留下你的联系方式，方便顾问结合你的阶段给出建议</h2>",
      "description": "<p>如果你还在评估期，我们会根据你的业务目标，安排更适合的方案沟通。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_contact_consult_name",
          "title": "<p>姓名</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "text",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入你的姓名",
            "maxLength": 40
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_contact_consult_company",
          "title": "<p>公司名称</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "text",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入公司名称",
            "maxLength": 80
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_contact_consult_phone",
          "title": "<p>手机号</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "dataType": "tel",
            "required": true,
            "placeholder": "请输入方便联系的手机号",
            "maxLength": 20
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "checkbox",
      "id": "question_nurture_content",
      "title": "<h2>如果你还在调研阶段，更希望先获取哪些内容？</h2>",
      "description": "<p>可多选，我们会把你带到更匹配的资料页。</p>",
      "attribute": {
        "required": true,
        "random": false,
        "media": []
      },
      "option": [
        {
          "id": "option_nurture_case_study",
          "title": "<p>客户案例 / 行业最佳实践</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_nurture_pricing",
          "title": "<p>价格方案 / 套餐说明</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "option_nurture_product_tour",
          "title": "<p>产品功能介绍 / Demo 视频</p>",
          "attribute": {
            "media": []
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "finish": [
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_hot_demo",
      "title": "<h2>非常适合直接安排产品演示</h2>",
      "description": "<p>我们已经记录你的需求与时间窗口。提交成功后，页面会带你进入预约演示入口，方便你直接锁定演示时间。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/book-demo",
        "mode": "immediate",
        "openIn": "blank"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_sales_consult",
      "title": "<h2>更适合先安排一场顾问咨询</h2>",
      "description": "<p>你已经进入明确评估阶段。提交成功后，页面会带你进入方案咨询入口，方便你继续了解适合的落地路径。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/sales-consult",
        "mode": "delay",
        "delayMs": 2500,
        "openIn": "self"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_nurture_content",
      "title": "<h2>我们先把最适合你的资料准备好</h2>",
      "description": "<p>提交成功后，页面会带你进入内容资料页，你可以先系统了解方案，再决定是否进入下一步。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/case-studies",
        "mode": "delay",
        "delayMs": 2200,
        "openIn": "self"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "finish",
      "id": "finish_self_serve_resources",
      "title": "<h2>先从公开资料开始也没问题</h2>",
      "description": "<p>如果你还没有明确计划，我们建议你先从产品总览、价格和案例开始。提交成功后，页面会带你进入自助资源中心。</p>",
      "media": [],
      "postSubmit": {
        "type": "redirect",
        "url": "https://example.com/resource-center",
        "mode": "immediate",
        "openIn": "self"
      }
    }
  ],
  "logic": [
    {
      "id": "logic_show_hot_contact",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_timeline",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_timeline_urgent"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_contact_hot"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_hot_contact_to_demo",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_contact_hot",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_hot_demo"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_consult_contact",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_timeline",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_timeline_this_quarter"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_contact_consult"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_consult_contact_to_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_contact_consult",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_sales_consult"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_show_nurture_content",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_timeline",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_timeline_research"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "show_question",
        "targetQuestionId": "question_nurture_content"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_research_to_finish",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_nurture_content",
        "operator": "answered"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_nurture_content"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "logic_no_plan_to_self_serve",
      "when": {
        "questionId": "question_timeline",
        "operator": "selected",
        "optionId": "option_timeline_no_plan"
      },
      "action": {
        "type": "end_survey",
        "targetQuestionId": "finish_self_serve_resources"
      }
    }
  ]
}